# Artificial Evolution changes the text of Minsc & Boo's spell, Hamster to Goblin (CR 612.1, 400.7a): the permanent says
# "Boo, a legendary 1/1 red Goblin creature token" (CR 612.4) and "If the sacrificed creature was a Goblin, draw X
# cards". The -2 sacrificing that Goblin Boo draws a card, which a Hamster test would not (Boo is no Hamster).

